{"availability":"available","full":"bps-statistics/form-gear","name":"form-gear","description":"FormGear is a framework engine for dynamic form creation and complex form processing and validation for data collection.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":114,"forks":13,"created":"2022-04-07T00:44:28Z","updated":"2022-11-04T05:40:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://solid-form-gear.vercel.app/","topics":["census","data","data-collection","form-builder","form-engine","form-generator","national-statistics","official-statistics","survey","survey-builder","survey-form"],"demo":"https://solid-form-gear.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.100Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.100Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.100Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.100Z","stars":114,"forks":13}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FormGear is a framework engine for dynamic form creation and complex form processing and validation for data collection. It is designed to work across multiple data collection platforms such as CAPI, CAWI, and PAPI.","FormGear is a framework engine for form creation, processing, and validation. FormGear was initially designed to support official statistics data collection in BPS - Statistics Indonesia, Indonesia's National Statistics Office, by a team under the direction of BPS. This requirement calls for dynamic form creation, complex processing and validation, and ease of use in the data collection process.","FormGear uses a defined JSON object template, thus is easy to build, use, and efficiently handle nested inquiries to capture everything down to the last detail. Unlike other similar framework, validation is handled in a FALSE condition in which each field is validated against a test equation. This leads to a more efficient and effective way of validating each component."],"features":["Easily create complex form with various form controls.","Divide form into several sections for ease during data collection.","Create nested form inquiry to accommodate recurring fields.","Add conditions to enable form control.","Validate answer given during data collection with your own test function."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bps-statistics/form-gear/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"306c0d785848e829e54436cc1c0cddd46fe94719d17fcafa3a06bbb5d65a693a","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.284Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.284Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FormGear is a framework engine for dynamic form creation and complex form processing and validation for data collection. It is designed to work across multiple data collection platforms such as CAPI, CAWI, and PAPI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bps-statistics/form-gear/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"306c0d785848e829e54436cc1c0cddd46fe94719d17fcafa3a06bbb5d65a693a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bps-statistics/form-gear/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.285Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2022-11-04T05:40:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bps-statistics/form-gear/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:35.286Z","hash":"306c0d785848e829e54436cc1c0cddd46fe94719d17fcafa3a06bbb5d65a693a","originalBytes":26898,"storedBytes":26898,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["value","label","datakey","input","type","data","form","field.","answer","components","validation","define","field","json","used","let","formgear","string","component","test","description","name","res","template","add","function","options","other","response","user","control","option","preset","remark","checkboxinput","collection.","each","getvalue","hobbies","number","table","corresponding","input.","list","listselectinputrepeat","message","code","collection","condition","console.log","example","function.","lets","lookup","range